// capsule/ — Capsule networks: capsules, dynamic routing, CapsNet.
//
// Depends on core and nn. The whole architecture is four files: the primitive
// (a capsule is a vector plus a presence probability), the routing algorithm
// that decides which capsules agree, the convolutional primary capsule that
// replaces pooling, and the full CapsNet that wires them together.
//
// dynamic_routing.mbt is separate from capsule.mbt because it is the part worth
// reusing: routing-by-agreement is a capsule-agnostic mechanism, and the
// agreement update is the only place in the package that iterates.
//
// embedding_net.mbt deliberately does not live here despite the adjacent name.
// It is a metric-learning embedding trained with a contrastive loss, not a
// capsule model; it stays in the root until someone splits the metric-learning
// side out properly.
import {
  "riantr/snn_mbt/core",
}
